WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:06.850
A pre-rendered SVG with CSS animation, pasted into the page. It needs no library at all.

2
00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:16.360
This SVG plays while its root has two classes: px-anim-enabled and px-anim-playing.

3
00:00:29.633 --> 00:00:33.317
Remove px-anim-playing, and it pauses where it is.

4
00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:52.534
Remove px-anim-enabled too, and it is back on its first frame.

5
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:11.202
Any script, any framework: add and remove two classes.
